{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当乌西雅、约坦、亚哈斯、希西家作犹大王的时候，亚摩斯的儿子以赛亚得默示，论到犹大和耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神责备以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"天哪，要听！地啊，侧耳而听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我养育儿女，将他们养大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们竟悖逆我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛认识主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驴认识主人的槽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列却不认识；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的民却不留意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"嗐！犯罪的国民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"担着罪孽的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行恶的种类，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"败坏的儿女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们离弃耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐视以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与他生疏，往后退步。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你们为什么屡次悖逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"还要受责打吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们已经满头疼痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全心发昏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从脚掌到头顶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有一处完全的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽是伤口、青肿，与新打的伤痕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都没有收口，没有缠裹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有用膏滋润。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你们的地土已经荒凉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的城邑被火焚毁。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的田地在你们眼前为外邦人所侵吞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"既被外邦人倾覆就成为荒凉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仅存锡安城","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像葡萄园的草棚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瓜田的茅屋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被围困的城邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是万军之耶和华给我们稍留余种，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们早已像所多玛、蛾摩拉的样子了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们这所多玛的官长啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听耶和华的话！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这蛾摩拉的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要侧耳听我们 神的训诲！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们所献的许多祭物与我何益呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公绵羊的燔祭和肥畜的脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已经够了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公牛的血，羊羔的血，公山羊的血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都不喜悦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"你们来朝见我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁向你们讨这些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们践踏我的院宇呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不要再献虚浮的供物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"香品是我所憎恶的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"月朔和安息日，并宣召的大会，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也是我所憎恶的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作罪孽，又守严肃会，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不能容忍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的月朔和节期，我心里恨恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都以为麻烦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我担当，便不耐烦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们举手祷告，我必遮眼不看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你们多多地祈祷，我也不听。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的手都满了杀人的血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要洗濯、自洁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从我眼前除掉你们的恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要止住作恶，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"学习行善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寻求公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解救受欺压的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给孤儿伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为寡妇辨屈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们来，我们彼此辩论。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪虽像朱红，必变成雪白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽红如丹颜，必白如羊毛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们若甘心听从，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必吃地上的美物，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不听从，反倒悖逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必被刀剑吞灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华亲口说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["罪大恶极的城"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"可叹，忠信的城变为妓女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从前充满了公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公义居在其中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现今却有凶手居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的银子变为渣滓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的酒用水搀对。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的官长居心悖逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与盗贼作伴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各都喜爱贿赂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追求赃私。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不为孤儿伸冤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寡妇的案件也不得呈到他们面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"因此，主—万军之耶和华、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的大能者说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哎！我要向我的对头雪恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我的敌人报仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必反手加在你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"炼尽你的渣滓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除净你的杂质。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必复还你的审判官，像起初一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"复还你的谋士，像起先一般。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然后，你必称为公义之城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忠信之邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"锡安必因公平得蒙救赎；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中归正的人必因公义得蒙救赎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但悖逆的和犯罪的必一同败亡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"离弃耶和华的必致消灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那等人必因你们所喜爱的橡树抱愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必因所选择的园子蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为，你们必如叶子枯干的橡树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像无水浇灌的园子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有权势的必如麻瓤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的工作好像火星，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要一同焚毁，无人扑灭。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/SNG/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}